Amaral A840 diagnostic lab: force TU_DEBUG=noubwc on the three-slice Adreno 840

Laboratório, não release. Base: candidata 5.7.14.1 (Mesa 69f1f21).
Degrau: L0, chip KGSL 0x44050a31 (e 0xffff44050a31). Demais GPUs inalteradas.
Objetivo: isolar a pixelização relatada no MUA3 em SM8850/A840.

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
index c317ed1b034..a8de8ad5b3b 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
@@ -1742,6 +1742,18 @@ tu_physical_device_init(struct tu_physical_device *device,
       device->dev_info = info;
       device->info = &device->dev_info;
 
+      /* Amaral A840 diagnostic lab (noubwc): force TU_DEBUG=noubwc only on the
+       * three-slice Adreno 840 (KGSL chip 0x44050a31) to isolate a reported
+       * pixelation. Not a fix and never distributed as a release.
+       */
+      if (device->dev_id.chip_id == 0x44050a31 ||
+          device->dev_id.chip_id == 0xffff44050a31) {
+         tu_env.start_debug |= TU_DEBUG_NOUBWC;
+         tu_env.debug.fetch_or(TU_DEBUG_NOUBWC, std::memory_order_acq_rel);
+         mesa_logi("Amaral A840 lab: TU_DEBUG noubwc forced for chip 0x%" PRIx64,
+                   device->dev_id.chip_id);
+      }
+
       device->usable_gmem_size_gmem =
          fd6_calc_gmem_cache_offsets(&info, device->gmem_size,
                                      &device->config_gmem,
